<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Results of experiments described in Sec. <a href="#S4.SS3" title="4.3 Role-playing Evaluation Set ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ RAGs to Riches: RAG-like Few-shot Learning for Large Language Model Role-playing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a> using <span id="S5.F3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Crowd Vote</span> to select for preference aligned with provided personalities in our role-playing settings.</figcaption>
